Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:20.55,main,Celia,0,0,0,,These plans for after graduation...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:23.50,main,Celia,0,0,0,,Rio's the only one who didn't write anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.34,flashback,Celia,0,0,0,,Where is it that you want to go, Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:29.50,flashback,Rio,0,0,0,,My parents' homeland, the Yagumo region.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.02,0:00:52.19,sign_3238_18_Seirei_Gensouki,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,125)\blur4\fad(897,1)}Seirei Gensouki
